<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Carlsberg bonus issue approved.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Carlsberg bonus issue approved.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carlsberg Brewery Malaysia Bhd said on Monday that the Securities Commission has recently approved its proposed one-for-two bonus issue.</p>
<p>In a statement, the brewery said the proposed issue will be implemented through the capitalisation of a portion of its retained earnings.</p>
<p>The bonus issue will now have to be approved by its shareholders at its annual meeting to be held on April 23, and by the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange for the listing and quotation of the new shares, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
